OL,3,AUkraine to restart strikes on Russian
OL,4,Aoil refineries, Zelensky says
OL,5,
OL,6,FZelensky also accused the US of
OL,7,Fwithdrawing intelligence-sharing on
OL,8,FRussian strikes to pressure Kyiv into
OL,9,Fending the attacks altogether after it
OL,10,Fstruck a deal to import Russian diesel,
OL,11,Fand said restrictions to Starlink
OL,12,Fsatellite services used by Ukraine's
OL,13,Fmilitary were deliberate.
OL,15,FThe Kremlin said Ukraine had "attempted
OL,16,Fa large-scale attack" on an oil
OL,17,Frefinery south of Moscow early on
OL,18,FThursday.
